        "title": "Thermal contact family and constraints",
        "statement": "Define a declared contact family and thermal-contact protocol permitting heat transfer while forbidding matter and mechanical or composition work; x~T y means contact leaves both equilibrium coordinates unchanged with no net heat transfer.",
