              "title": "Daniel Arovas, Lecture Notes on Thermodynamics and Statistical Mechanics, §§2.5–2.6 and §2.9",
              "url": "https://courses.physics.ucsd.edu/2010/Spring/physics210a/LECTURES/STATMECH.pdf"
